IP service and added labels placed from map data.</div><div role="listitem">The north end of Pawleys Island at low tide: houses along the dune line, and the inlet at right. Photo: Phoebe, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pawleys_Island_North_End.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons</a>. Resized and saved as WebP by Chapter3 Realty; the file is not cut. The page crops it with the browser.</div><div role="listitem">Chapter3 Realty resized these photos and cropped some of them. Each photo keeps the license listed with it.</div></div></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/buyers-relocating-which-town/loris-downtown-from-above-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/buyers-relocating-which-town/loris-downtown-from-above-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":900,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"Downtown Loris from above: shop buildings along the main streets by the railroad, with houses on big yards around them","caption":"Downtown Loris from above: shop buildings along the main streets by the railroad, with houses on big yards around them.","description":"Aerial photo of downtown Loris with blocks of low shop buildings beside a railroad, parking lots, a hayfield and houses on big yards around them","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP"},"creditText":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP, public domain, via The National Map (USGS)","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP)","license":"https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/","acquireLicensePage":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","isBasedOn":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAI